	(text "TMC5130 Rsense options in stock, approx full-scale current at CS=31:\n360m 1206 250mW: vsense=0 0.60A RMS / 0.86A peak; vsense=1 0.33A RMS / 0.47A peak  OW-PASS-RL1206FR-070R36L\n150m 1206 1W:    vsense=0 1.35A RMS / 1.91A peak; vsense=1 0.75A RMS / 1.06A peak  OW-PASS-RLH12FTCR150\n120m 1206 750mW: vsense=0 1.64A RMS / 2.32A peak; vsense=1 0.91A RMS / 1.29A peak  OW-PASS-KRL1632E-M-R120-F-T5\nSet lower current in firmware; choose Rsense so normal IRUN is ~16-31.\nTMC5130 TQFP thermal behavior needs validation above ~1.2A RMS continuous."
